% M22-review-bugs (D-0231): a CONSTANT letter above the automaton's symbols. The one-state
% automaton reads only symbol 0, so the letter 4 labels no edge and the constraint is false.
% Before D-0231 regular.ml's forward_reason indexed its predecessor table with 4 and the
% solver stopped on Invalid_argument("index out of bounds") (found by agent-scp, D-0230 s7).
predicate baguette_regular(array [int] of var int: x,int: Q,int: smin,array [int] of int: d,int: q0,array [int] of int: F,array [int] of var bool: s);
var 0..1: x :: output_var;
var bool: s1;
var bool: s2;
var bool: s3;
constraint baguette_regular([x, 4], 1, 0, [1], 1, [1], [s1, s2, s3]);
solve satisfy;
